      "content": "OpticOdds offers real-time and historical sports betting data including\nmain-line odds, player props, alternate markets, injury data, schedules,\nrankings, and scores. The API is REST-based and authenticated with an\nAPI key passed either as the `X-Api-Key` header or `key` query\nparameter.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: OpticOdds Developer",
